 [270, 314.0000305175781], "pos": [0, 0], "id": 14, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [26], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["908f102f5b757476e95e557ca8b6030390b60215b9ffbb4fe0d7f04f729965a3.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "Load Image2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [270, 314], "pos": [270, 0], "id": 19, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [27], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["【风格】都市情感短片（Urban Romance），超写实电影级（Photorealistic），2.39:1变形宽银幕，暖金色黄昏光+柔焦氛围（Soft Glow），浅景深，高帧率升格\n【时长】15秒\n【场景】黄昏天台角落——水泥墙面带风化纹理，墙根几盆绿植，远处城市天际线落日余晖橙粉渐变，晚风轻拂\n【角色】小灰@图片1；小青@图片2\n\n[00:00-00:04] 镜头1：壁咚（Kabedon Impact Shot）\n中景侧拍：小灰背靠水泥墙，小青大步逼近，右手猛地拍在小灰耳侧墙面上——砰，水泥灰尘微微震落（Impact FX）。左手撑在另一侧，双臂将小灰困在中间。小灰后背贴墙，肩膀微缩，仰头瞪大眼睛，嘴唇微张，呼吸急促。\n切近景（Cut to Close-up）：小青居高临下微微俯身，长发垂落在小灰肩膀上，眼神霸道又温柔，嘴角带一丝不容拒绝的笑。落日侧光打在两人脸上，小青投下的影子笼罩小灰半张脸。\n\n[00:04-00:07] 镜头2：沦陷对望（Extreme Close-up, Slow Push-in）\n极近特写升格慢动作：小青撑墙的左手松开，指尖划过小灰的下颌线，拇指按住她的下唇轻轻往下拉了一点。小灰睫毛颤动，眼眶泛红，瞳孔里映着小青的脸和身后橙色天空，从抗拒到放弃抵抗——眼神融化，缓缓闭眼，下巴微微抬起迎上去。\n\n[00:07-00:15] 镜头3：忘情长吻（Orbital Slow-mo + Pull-back）\n侧面近景：小青俯身吻上小灰的嘴唇，小灰贴在墙上的双手从僵直到慢慢松开，攥住小青运动背心的腰侧面料，指节发白，把她往自己方向拽。小青右手从墙面滑下，穿过小灰短发扣住她后脑勺，吻得更深，两人额头抵紧。\n镜头开始半环绕慢移（Orbital Shot, Super Slow-mo）：绕过侧面到四分之三角度，晚风吹起小青的长发扫过两人交叠的面颊，发丝被夕阳打成金色丝线。小灰的另一只手伸上去扣住小青撑墙那只手的手腕，十指慢慢交握扣紧。\n缓拉至中远景（Slow Pull-back）：两人紧贴墙面相拥接吻的剪影融入巨大橙红落日中，城市天际线虚化成暖色光斑（Bokeh），远处楼宇灯光一盏盏亮起——画面定格（Freeze Frame），暮色收束。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)-提示词：", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [910, 0], "id": 20, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4276.55517578125, 259.30816650390625], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-883.277587890625, -581.2376098632812], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 412, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【jcsogz1s】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fec806"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3079.4951171875, 171.5588836669922], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-258.621337890625, -221.5588836669922], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 413, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "每天登录还有100币  邀请码：【jcsogz1s】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff29f8"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [821], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [355.13226318359375, 82], "pos": [2605.332763671875, 559.9248046875], "widgets_values": ["anima_baseV10.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}